                    <h3 data-key="about_title">Trusted Financial Partners Since 2009</h3>
                    <p data-key="about_p1">Ranasinghe & Associates is a leading professional services firm in Sri Lanka, specializing in assurance, accounting, and tax services. Under the leadership of Managing Partner P. Ranasinghe, we have built a reputation for excellence, integrity, and client-focused solutions.</p>
                    <p data-key="about_p2">With offices in Galle and Colombo, we serve businesses of all sizes across Sri Lanka, providing comprehensive financial services that help our clients achieve their business objectives and maintain regulatory compliance.</p>
